    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f9/Kilty_%26_Patch_Sharp_Paired_Blades_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260314233649\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Kilty \u0026amp; Patch Sharp Paired Blades Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f9/Kilty_%26_Patch_Sharp_Paired_Blades_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260314233649\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1014\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Kilty \u0026amp; Patch Sharp Paired Blades Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Kilty_%26_Patch_Sharp_Paired_Blades_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eSharp Paired Blades\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA pair of Warrior beauties, \u0027\u003ci\u003eKilty \u0026amp; Patch\u003c/i\u003e\" hunt their prey trough dazzling cooperative attacks.\nThey interlock their massive twin blades, stealing their opponent\u0027s distance and stance at once with slashed and pincer strikes.\nThe moment their breaths align, even the very path of escape is said to cut away.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8a/Kilty_and_Patch_Sharp_Paired_Blades_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260314233821\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Kilty and Patch Sharp Paired Blades S Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8a/Kilty_and_Patch_Sharp_Paired_Blades_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260314233821\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"997\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Kilty and Patch Sharp Paired Blades S Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Kilty_and_Patch_Sharp_Paired_Blades_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a7/Kilty_and_Patch_SPB_Blooming_in_the_Rain_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260619200624\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Kilty and Patch SPB Blooming in the Rain Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a7/Kilty_and_Patch_SPB_Blooming_in_the_Rain_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260619200624\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"957\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Kilty and Patch SPB Blooming in the Rain Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Kilty_and_Patch_SPB_Blooming_in_the_Rain_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820012428\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n--\u003e\n\u003c!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\